runvx image-I/O GDF samples — not runnable in this build
========================================================

This vision-pack build ships `runvx` WITHOUT OpenCV (OpenCV is excluded by
design to avoid its heavy transitive dependencies). `runvx` therefore has no
image/video file I/O.

The GDF samples in this directory that read image files — `canny.gdf` and
`skintonedetect.gdf` — need an OpenCV-enabled `runvx`. Running them against the
shipped `runvx` fails with:

    ERROR: This build doesn't support CAMERA option

They are kept as GDF graph references. To run them, rebuild `runvx` against an
OpenCV-enabled MIVisionX. See vision-pack issue #68.
